// UI strings for app.html and parts.html in zh-TW (the text the pages ship
// today, verbatim), English and Japanese.
//
// Keys are stable dot paths grouped by area. Values that interpolate use
// {name} placeholders; every language carries exactly the same placeholder set
// (i18n/test.mjs checks it). A comment above each group names where the zh-TW
// text lives today, so swapping a literal for t('key', vars) is mechanical.
//
// Money: the zh-TW originals format totals in 萬 ("NT$12.3 萬"). Templates here
// take a ready-formatted {amount} instead, so the caller formats it for the
// viewer's region with i18n.js price()/money helpers; zh-TW keeps its 萬 form
// by passing the 萬 figure as {amount} where the original did.
//
// Catalogue text (labels, notes, finish names) is NOT here: see catalogue.js.

